  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay comfortable and concealed with Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Zip Up Hoodie. Crafted from breathable 100% polyester with a soft fleece lining, it provides warmth without bulk. Featuring massive kangaroo pockets with zippers, an extra chest pocket, and a left sleeve zippered arm pocket, it offers ample storage for essentials. The extra-large hood ensures coverage, while the mandarin collar with fabric guard enhances comfort. Additionally, the loop field on the arms allows for attaching morale patches, adding personalization.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3779",
  "description": "<p>Stay comfortable and concealed with Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Zip Up Hoodie. Crafted from breathable 100% polyester with a soft fleece lining, it provides warmth without bulk. Featuring massive kangaroo pockets with zippers, an extra chest pocket, and a left sleeve zippered arm pocket, it offers ample storage for essentials. The extra-large hood ensures coverage, while the mandarin collar with fabric guard enhances comfort. Additionally, the loop field on the arms allows for attaching morale patches, adding personalization. With wire pass-throughs in the kangaroo and chest pockets, it accommodates headphones for on-the-go convenience. Whether you&rsquo;re out for a hike, running errands, or lounging at home, Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Zip Up Hoodie delivers both comfort and functionality.</p>",
